0245951456670", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974493_2120245954790003_5966831534778103198_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RvRWNaeEEl4Q7kNvwHIPx6f&_nc_oc=Adk2ltAJoI72WO1W9QYCJ0bEaLkoOt6XJPGAKDUq3iQEpOW8oY_FUuSoXrOX2U8bOAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsdA16cPb6n9pAC5XnD2Y7Dp7lV5R7aGcpB-MK-BsJ2jA&oe=69A2C666"}, "display_name": "Luna: Episode 1 - Left Behind (DEMO)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "LUNA: EPISODE 1 - LEFT BEHIND is a 25-30 minute interactive VR story about an android and a little girl trying to survive an AI apocalypse. The machines seem to be after only one goal: to exterminate its creators. \n\u200b\nYou, a small commercial droid, wake up and find your system to be reset.\nCan you, a droid with no combat capabilities, protect Luna? Can humanity be saved?\n\nFeatures:\n- Talk to the characters. LUNA uses speech recognition to help you immerse in the story and connect with the characters. \n- Dialogue options will guide you through the story while letting you make meaningful decisions that impact the ending.\n- Prepare for an emotional ride. The story is full of heart-warming and uplifting moments.", "short_description": "LUNA: EPISODE 1 - LEFT BEHIND is a 25-30 minute interactive VR story about an android and a little girl trying to survive an AI apocalypse. The machines seem to be after only one goal: to exterminate its creators. \n\u200b\nYou, a small commercial droid, wake up and find your system to be reset.\nCan you, a droid with no combat capabilities, protect Luna? Can humanity be saved?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lunavrstory.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "N/A", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.lunavrstory.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_categor